  "authorNotes": "KG English, 11 sections = 11 syllabus rows, 100 written marks. No Mohammadpur 2026 KG final exists; the main guide was MP Final 2025 KG English (PDF), and almost every item is reused from it because its words sit exactly on the Sylhet book pages: missing letters (p54-55), jumbled words (p57-58), Bangla-to-English (p34-39), English-to-Bangla (p46-51), opposites (p62-64). Note: the file 'KG-Eng 2025.docx' in the MP Half-yearly 2025 folder is actually a Final 2025 variant (header says 'Final Examination 2025'); used it only for letters M and T and cited it as the docx version. Doubts for the owner: (1) Row 1 label says '6 letters' but the published count is 9 x 3 = 27; I followed the count and gave 9 letters (M O P R S T W Z from M-Z, plus H as A-L revision). If 6 was meant, the marks table needs fixing. (2) Row 11 label says 'six framed sentences' but the count is 4 x 2 = 8; I gave 4 sentences (name, age, class, father's name). (3) Row 7: MP's 'circle A/An' turned into fill-in blanks; 'eagle' replaced by 'egg' because eagle is not on the a/an pages. (4) Row 8: set A = animals, set B = vegetables (MP's choice); swap to birds / fruits if preferred. (5) Oral 10, dictation 5 and handwriting 2 are outside the 100 per the syllabus, so no oral section was added. Oral prompts, if wanted: question-answer (page 100), months, seasons, five flower names, five bird names. (6) Duration '2 hours' taken from the MP paper. Book page numbers are printed page numbers of KG - ENGLISH (2026)."
